// Verify via Groebner elimination: the z-coordinate satisfies t^3 - 1 = 0.
// t^3 - 1 has discriminant -27 != 0, so 3 distinct roots over Qbar.
// Each of the 3! permutations of these distinct roots is an ordered solution.

